---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Farm Machinery & Equipment Directory | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Find tractors, planters, harvesters, irrigation, processing, greenhouse and other agricultural machinery and equipment resources.
permalink: "/farm-machinery/"
---
{% set listings = directoryListings.listings | default([]) %}
{% set equipment = listings | selectattr("type","equalto","equipment") | selectattr("active","equalto",true) | list %}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;"><div class="container" style="max-width:1000px;">
<span class="eyebrow">Machinery Directory</span><h1>Farm Machinery & Equipment</h1>
<p class="lede">A structured directory for machinery dealers, equipment providers, leasing services and farm mechanisation resources.</p>
{% if equipment | length %}<div style="display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:28px;">{% for item in equipment %}{% if item.verification_status != "closed" and item.verification_status != "expired" %}<article style="padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><h2 style="margin-top:0;">{{ item.title }}</h2><p><strong>{{ item.country }}</strong>{% if item.region %} · {{ item.region }}{% endif %}</p>{% if item.equipment_category %}<p><strong>Category:</strong> {{ item.equipment_category | replace("_"," ") }}</p>{% endif %}<p>{{ item.description }}</p>{% if item.lease_terms %}<p><strong>Lease / rental:</strong> {{ item.lease_terms }}</p>{% endif %}{% if item.application_url %}<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ item.application_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Provider / Application</a>{% elif item.url %}<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Provider Website</a>{% endif %}</article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div style="margin-top:28px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><h2>No verified machinery listings are published yet</h2><p>We are building the equipment directory around identifiable providers and official sources rather than unverified marketplace adverts.</p></div>{% endif %}
<p style="margin-top:28px;"><a href="/agriculture-resources/">← Back to Agricultural Resources</a></p></div></section>
